## ⚙️ O'rnatish va ishga tushirish

```bash
# 1. Repozitoriyni yuklab oling
git clone https://github.com/username/repo-name.git

# 2. Papkaga kiring
cd repo-name

# 3. Kutubxonalarni o'rnating
npm install

# 4. Loyihani ishga tushiring
npm run dev
```

